  <section data-tab-panel="method" style="display:none">
    <div class="method-body">
      <h3>{{ t('What this HK lab measures', '本HK实验室测量什么') }}</h3>
      <p>{{ t('20 frozen HK candidate pick engines run in parallel on forward ledgers in the asia-close lane. Each book fires picks nightly; those picks are graded when the horizon elapses. Nothing here drives live selection. The purpose is evidence accrual: let the data tell us which HK constructions are worth a formal gauntlet.', '20个冻结HK候选选股引擎在亚盘通道的前向账本上并行运行。每本书每晚触发选择；当地平线经过时，这些选择被评级。这里没有任何内容驱动实时选股。目的是证据累积：让数据告诉我们哪些港股构造值得正式考验。') }}</p>

      <h3>{{ t('Ruler (HKPL-R3)', '标尺（HKPL-R3）') }}</h3>
      <div class="law">
        <b>{{ t('Primary ruler: 21-session ^HSI excess — win rate + median excess. 5/10/63-session descriptive ladder also recorded. MFE/MAE over 25 sessions.', '主标尺：21节恒生（^HSI）超额 — 胜率+中位超额。同时记录5/10/63节描述性阶梯。25节MFE/MAE。') }}</b>
        {{ t('Inverse books (Knife Avoid, Chase Avoid): scored as avoid-accuracy — expected negative 21-session excess.', '反向书（刀口规避、追涨规避）：评分为规避准确性 — 预期21节负超额。') }}
      </div>

      <h3>{{ t('Execution law (HKPL-R4)', '执行法则（HKPL-R4）') }}</h3>
      <div class="law">
        <b>{{ t('Exec = next HK session close (fill_basis="close"). No price limits — HK has no daily limit. Board lots ignored at ledger tier (noted, not modeled).', '执行 = 下一港股交易节收盘价（fill_basis="close"）。无涨跌停 — 港股无每日限制。账本层忽略手数（已注明，未建模）。') }}</b>
        <b>{{ t('Halt law: if the exec session has no print, fill at the first traded session within 5 sessions, else the fire is voided (halt_voided counter). A name halted >5 consecutive sessions inside a grade window grades to last trade with halted=true — never silent ffill.', '停牌法则：若执行节无成交，在5节内首个有成交节入场，否则触发撤销（halt_voided计数）。评级窗口内连续停牌>5节的个股以最后成交价评级并标记halted=true — 绝不静默填充。') }}</b>
      </div>

      <h3>{{ t('Organ staleness (HKPL-R7)', '器官陈旧度（HKPL-R7）') }}</h3>
      <div class="law">
        <b>{{ t('A book input staler than 2 HK sessions disables that book for the night (fail-closed). The disabled_stale_nights counter on the scoreboard tracks how many nights each organ-dependent book was suppressed.', '书的输入数据超过2个港股交易节将使该书当夜停用（故障关闭）。记分板上的disabled_stale_nights计数器跟踪每本器官依存书被抑制的夜数。') }}</b>
      </div>

      <h3>{{ t('HK kill laws (spec §8)', 'HK禁止法则（规格§8）') }}</h3>
      <div class="kill-law">
        <b>{{ t('NO residual/selection momentum ranks. NO southbound delta-ranking (SB_ACCUM organ signal = legal). NO COILED books for HK. NO Connect-inclusion event books.', '无残差/选择动量排名。无南向资金增量排名（SB_ACCUM器官信号 = 合法）。无HK盘绕书。无互联互通纳入事件书。') }}</b>
        {{ t('Inverse books (Knife Avoid, Chase Avoid) are AVOID books — expected negative excess. The 20 books use beta-role, organ-state, and leverage-mechanics constructions — not momentum factors.', '反向书（刀口规避、追涨规避）是规避书 — 预期负超额。20本书使用贝塔角色、器官状态和杠杆机制构造 — 而非动量因子。') }}
      </div>

      <h3>{{ t('Controls (HKPL-R5)', '控制变量（HKPL-R5）') }}</h3>
      <p>{{ t('Every book is measured against two yardsticks: (1) the HK Random Control book (8 deterministic-random liquid names, seed = sha256(engine_id+asof)), visible in the scoreboard; and (2) the universe buy-anytime base rate. Every headline number is lift over both.', '每本书均与两个基准进行比较：（1）HK随机控制书（8个确定性随机流动名称，种子=sha256(engine_id+asof)），在记分板中可见；以及（2）全市场随时买入基准率。每个标题数字是相对于两者的提升。') }}</p>

      <h3>{{ t('ACCRUING floor (HKPL-R6)', '累积下限（HKPL-R6）') }}</h3>
      <div class="law">
        <b>{{ t('No verdict language before n≥25 fires spanning ≥3 calendar months and ≥6 distinct fire dates. Refire lockout: 21 sessions (HKPL-R6). Max 8 picks/day (small HK universe ~160 names).', '在n≥25次触发跨越≥3个日历月和≥6个不同触发日期之前，无结论语言。重触锁定：21节（HKPL-R6）。每日最多8个选择（港股小宇宙约160只）。') }}</b>
        {{ t('Until then, the status badge reads ACCRUING.', '在此之前，状态徽章显示ACCRUING。') }}
      </div>

      <h3>{{ t('No Long-Hold grid (HKPL-R9)', '无长持网格（HKPL-R9）') }}</h3>
      <p>{{ t('HK long-hold grids are deliberately deferred: the H3/H2a edges are already accruing under their own programs. Revisit only with dedicated pre-registration.', 'HK长持网格被故意推迟：H3/H2a优势已在各自程序下累积。仅凭专用预注册方可重新审视。') }}</p>

      <h3>{{ t('Candidate families', '候选族') }}</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><b>A — {{ t('1D Velocity:', '1日速度：') }}</b> {{ t('5 books — 1D MACD/StochRSI cross-up entry timing; cross×washout organ; ADR overnight confirmation; blastoff (3D gate miss); regime (Risk-on + peg ok).', '5本书 — 1日MACD/StochRSI交叉上穿入场时机；交叉×洗盘器官；ADR隔夜确认；起飞（3日门遗漏）；状态（风险偏好开启+联系汇率正常）。') }}</li>
        <li><b>B — {{ t('Washout/Ignition (organ):', '洗盘/点火（器官）：') }}</b> {{ t('5 books — ignition_watch strongest state; washout×SB_ACCUM confluence; washout×buyback; pullback second-chance entry; Knife Avoid INVERSE (knife_risk=True).', '5本书 — ignition_watch最强状态；洗盘×南向积累汇流；洗盘×回购；回调第二次机会入场；刀口规避反向（knife_risk=True）。') }}</li>
        <li><b>C — {{ t('HK-unique structure:', 'HK特有结构：') }}</b> {{ t('4 books — CBBC bear-skew forced-buy fuel; A/H discount value (H3 near-GO); short squeeze (SFC pressure+RSI reclaim); catalyst+narrative attention shock.', '4本书 — CBBC空头偏斜强制买入燃料；A/H折价价值（H3接近通过）；轧空（SFC压力+RSI收复）；催化剂+叙事关注冲击。') }}</li>
        <li><b>D — {{ t('Beta/Regime:', '贝塔/状态：') }}</b> {{ t('3 books — amplifiers on Risk-on; cushions on Risk-off; HIBOR EASY liquidity + washout_2w rebound.', '3本书 — 风险偏好开启时的放大器；风险回避时的缓冲；HIBOR宽松流动性+2周洗盘反弹。') }}</li>
        <li><b>E — {{ t('Ablations + Controls:', '消融+控制：') }}</b> {{ t('3 books — flagship no-gate ablation (edge_z, no signal-gate grouping); Chase Avoid INVERSE (chase_risk state, RSI≥70 gapped); HK Random Control yardstick.', '3本书 — 旗舰无门消融（edge_z，无信号门分组）；追涨规避反向（chase_risk状态，RSI≥70跳空）；HK随机控制基准。') }}</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>{{ t('Clocks', '时钟') }}</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>{{ t('2026-08-20 — first operator read; 1D-vs-stale-cross diagnostic first look; prune degenerate books.', '2026-08-20 — 第一次操作员读取；1日vs迟滞交叉诊断首次查看；修剪退化书本。') }}</li>
        <li>{{ t('2026-10-09 — floor-eligible verdict window (n≥25/≥3mo/≥6 dates) for high-frequency books.', '2026-10-09 — 高频书的达标评判窗口（n≥25/≥3月/≥6日期）。') }}</li>
        <li>{{ t('2027-01 — H3 come-back clock; hklab_ah_value re-baselines if H3 promotes/changes.', '2027-01 — H3回归时钟；H3晋升/变更时hklab_ah_value重新基准。') }}</li>
      </ul>

      {% if method_note %}
      <h3>{{ t('Notes from last run', '上次运行说明') }}</h3>
      <p>{{ method_note }}</p>
      {% endif %}

      <p style="margin-top:20px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted)">
        {{ t('Authority: display_only. All rows carry authority: "display_only" per HKPL-R1.', '授权：仅展示。所有行按照HKPL-R1携带授权："display_only"。') }}
        · {{ t('Built', '生成时间') }} {{ built }}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</div><!-- .pl-wrap -->

<!-- ── inline tab-switch JS ── -->
<script>
(function () {
  'use strict';
  /* main tab switcher */
  var tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.pl-tabs .tabbtn');
  var panels = document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab-panel]');
  tabs.forEach(function (btn) {
    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var id = btn.getAttribute('data-tab');
      tabs.forEach(function (b) { b.classList.remove('on'); });
      panels.forEach(function (p) { p.style.display = 'none'; });
      btn.classList.add('on');
      var panel = document.querySelector('[data-tab-panel="' + id + '"]');
      if (panel) panel.style.display = 'block';
    });
  });
  /* All Books chip selector */
  var chips = document.querySelectorAll('#ab-chips .book-chip');
  chips.forEach(function (chip) {
    chip.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var id = chip.getAttribute('data-ab');
      chips.forEach(function (c) { c.classList.remove('on'); });
      document.querySelectorAll('.ab-panel').forEach(function (p) { p.style.display = 'none'; });
      chip.classList.add('on');
      var panel = document.getElementById('ab-' + id);
      if (panel) panel.style.display = 'block';
    });
  });
})();
</script>
<script src="theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
